msgid ""
" - [#1]: John MacDonald. The Arctic Sky: Inuit Astronomy, Star Lore and Legend.\n"
" - [#2]: [Wikipedia article on Inuit astronomy](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuit_astronomy)"
msgstr ""
" - [#1]: John MacDonald. The Arctic Sky: Inuit Astronomy, Star Lore and Legend.\n"
" - [#2]: [Wikipedia article on Inuit astronomy](http://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Inuit_astronomy)"

